  "question": "Can 《冀淑英文集》 pp.383–385, cited by Liu Qiang in 2010, be used as a page locator for Ji Shuying's Tieqin narrative or 《百川归海，蔚为大观》?",
  "answer": "No. Direct review of Liu Qiang's official Palace Museum article pages 62–63 shows that the citation to 《冀淑英文集》 pp.383–385 occurs in a cross-page discussion of state-supported bulk acquisition of the Shanghai collector Chen Qinghua's library. This calibrates the function of the citation in Liu's article and makes pp.383–385 an unauthorized shortcut for locating 《百川归海，蔚为大观》 or the Tieqin chapter. The underlying Ji pages themselves have not been directly reviewed, so this does not prove that they contain no Tieqin-related material.",
